From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:10:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: duo.config: build the DW9719 lens driver

The IMX351 module's autofocus actuator (Dongwoon DW9800K, driven by dw9719). It was built out of tree before.

This patch was written by Claude (Anthropic's AI assistant) under the direction of Bryson, who reviewed and
tested it on a Surface Duo.

Signed-off-by: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/duo.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/duo.config b/arch/arm64/configs/duo.config
index e842f3d67..e003ff4f8 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/duo.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/duo.config
@@ -721,3 +721,4 @@ CONFIG_USB_U_SERIAL=y
 CONFIG_USB_XHCI_PCI_RENESAS=y
 # CONFIG_USER_EVENTS is not set
 CONFIG_VETH=y
+CONFIG_VIDEO_DW9719=m
